            "title": "美股｜美股兩日急瀉 納指累跌8% VIX飈見高位 大行警告脆弱性風險",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜美股兩日急瀉 納指累跌8% VIX飈見高位 大行警告脆弱性風險\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜美股兩日急瀉 納指累跌8% VIX飈見高位 大行警告脆弱性風險</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美股爆發近月最猛烈拋售，納斯達克100指數於周四及周五兩日合共累跌約8%，標普500指數自高位回落逾一成，技術上步入調整區，VIX升至2025年4月關稅風波以來最高。美銀及摩根大通警告，期權市場結構正在逆轉，突發性拋售恐更頻繁，市場長期累積的脆弱性風險正全面浮面。AI交易信心動搖為導火線，Anthropic完成大型IPO後翌日股價即大幅回吐。</p></div>",
